# a first look and listen: D Kurd in the Pan layout, a run out from the ding, every page
# (params: 0 Metal 1 Strike 2 Sustain 3 Harmonics 4 Size 5 Thickness 6 Sympathy 7 Port 8 Reverb 9 Room
#  10 Delay 11 Time 12 Tape 13 Lo-fi 14 Chorus 15 Filter 16 Grains 17 Grain ms 18 Density 19 Pitch
#  20 Spray 21 Feedback 22 Width 23 Layout 24 Scale 25 Key 26 Black 27 Duo 28 Duo level 29 Percussion
#  30 Octave 31 Worn 32 Humanize 33 Tuning 34 Release 35 Groove 36 Tempo 37 Tune 38 MIDI ch 39 MIDI out
#  40 Theme)
wav first.wav
wait 300
shot hello.png
wait 1500
shot home.png
expect view 0
expect par24 0
expect par25 2
# D Kurd as a maker lays it out: the ding on both middle keys, the fields zigzag out, the first on the
# right (A3 right, Bb3 left, C4 right, D4 left ... C5)
expect white7 5000
expect white8 5000
expect white9 5700
expect white6 5800
expect white10 6000
expect white5 6200
expect white12 6700
expect white3 6900
expect white13 7200
# past the pan's own fields, the scale goes on (D Kurd: one more, D5); the two keys at each end are the
# steel
expect white2 7400
expect white0 -1
expect white1 -1
expect white14 -1
expect white15 -1
# the ding, then out and up: D | A Bb C D E F G A C
tapkey w8
tapkey w9
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
tapkey w5
tapkey w11
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
tapkey w3
tapkey w13
wait 50
shot ringing.png
expect note6900 >10
expect voices >5
leds
wait 2500
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
expect peak_db_min -30
# the pages, by their buttons; a button pressed again shows its next page, and round
# (0 Pan 1 Shell | 2 Touch | 3 Space 4 Color | 5 Grain 6 Spread | 7 Keys 8 Duo | 9 Groove | 10 Setup)
tap HOME
expect view 1
wait 50
shot shell.png
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap ENV
expect view 2
shot touch.png
tap FX
expect view 3
shot space.png
tap FX
expect view 4
wait 50
shot color.png
tap FX
expect view 3
tap LFO
expect view 5
shot grain.png
tap LFO
expect view 6
wait 50
shot spread.png
tap SEL
expect view 7
shot keys.png
tap SEL
expect view 8
wait 50
shot duo_page.png
tap SEQ
expect view 9
wait 50
shot groove.png
tap GLO
expect view 10
shot setup.png
tap EDIT
expect view 0
tap EDIT
expect view 1
# ARP held: the Groove page, and the groove left as it was
press ARP
wait 700
release ARP
expect view 9
expect pat 0
tap GLO
# the encoders: SELECT metal, ALGORITHM scale (in the key it's usually made in), PRESETS key
turn SELECT 1
expect par0 1
turn ALGO 3
expect par24 3
# Pygmy comes in F#: F#3 / G# A C# E F# G# A C#
expect par25 6
expect white8 5400
expect white9 5600
wait 50
shot pygmy.png
turn PRESET -1
expect par25 5
expect white8 5300
# Octave: the ding an octave down, and back
tap OCT-
expect par30 -1
expect white8 4100
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
expect par30 1
expect white8 6500
tap OCT+
expect par30 1
# knobs on the Pan page
tap HOME
expect view 0
spin K2 -20
expect par1 20
spin K3 30
expect par2 85
wait 50
shot knobs.png
expect dirty 1
